OL,3,GNEWSAWales' 'oldest man', 107, says
OL,4,Afish and chips key to long life
OL,5,
OL,6,FFor 107-year-old World War Two veteran
OL,7,FOwen Filer, one of the secrets to his
OL,8,Flongevity has been a regular visit to
OL,9,Fthe chippy.
OL,11,F"I've never overeaten... I lived on
OL,12,Ffish and chips," he said at a
OL,13,Fcelebration on Friday, ahead of his
OL,14,Fbirthday on Monday.
OL,16,F"Fish and chips, a full meal, a scoop
OL,17,Ffull of chips and a fish."
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,439,430,260,140,0,100
