OL,3,GNEWSAWales' 'oldest man', 107, says
OL,4,Afish and chips key to long life
OL,5,
OL,6,FAside from this, Filer, who lives in
OL,7,FCwmbran, Torfaen, and is believed to be
OL,8,FWales' oldest man, said there was "no
OL,9,Fsecret" to a long life other than
OL,10,Fliving "properly".
